### 错题管理接口测试

### 第一步：获取有效token
POST http://localhost:8081/api/user/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

userId=S003&password=123456

### 1. 添加错题
POST http://localhost:8084/api/practice/questions/28/wrong
Content-Type: application/json
satoken: 2e1a71fa-58f7-4267-8d22-ed802ce7b915

{
    "wrongAnswer": "数据库"
}

### 2. 获取错题列表（全部）
GET http://localhost:8084/api/practice/questions/wrong
satoken: 2e1a71fa-58f7-4267-8d22-ed802ce7b915

### 3. 获取课程错题列表
GET http://localhost:8084/api/practice/questions/wrong/course/2
satoken: 2e1a71fa-58f7-4267-8d22-ed802ce7b915

### 4. 删除错题
DELETE http://localhost:8084/api/practice/questions/6/wrong
satoken: 2e1a71fa-58f7-4267-8d22-ed802ce7b915
